---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Artwork from '../components/Artwork.astro';
---

<Base pageKey="process">
<main>
<section data-hero="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:110px 72px 70px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:34px">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;max-width:760px">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Our process</div>
    <h1 data-h1="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:66px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.03">Good creative work needs room to explore — and a process that keeps it moving.</h1>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:620px">Five stages, one continuous project. At any point you know where things stand, what we need from you and what happens next. Timing is confirmed after discovery and scope approval — never quoted before the work is understood.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-art-id="create-process-flow" data-art="create-process-flow" data-art-slot="" style="position:relative;height:240px;border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;pointer-events:none"><Artwork id="create-process-flow" />
    <div data-art-note="" style="padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:520px">
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — PROCESS FLOW</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">32:5 desktop · 21:9 tablet · 3:4 vertical mobile render required</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 72px 40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.4fr;gap:60px;padding:56px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.09);position:relative">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;position:sticky;top:110px;align-self:start">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;color:#8B5CF6">01</span><span style="width:64px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6)"></span></div>
      <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:40px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.06">Discovery</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:620px">Before anything is drawn, we learn the business. What it sells, who buys it, what the site has to achieve. You bring goals, content and constraints; we ask the awkward questions early, while they are still cheap to answer.</p>
      <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 30px;padding:26px 30px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Business goals</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Audience</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Scope</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Content</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Requirements</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Research</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.4fr;gap:60px;padding:56px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.09);position:relative">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;position:sticky;top:110px;align-self:start">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;color:#8B5CF6">02</span><span style="width:64px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6)"></span></div>
      <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:40px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.06">Visual Direction</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:620px">Structure and creative direction are proposed together and agreed before production starts. This is the stage where opinions matter most — your approval here sets everything that follows, so we would rather spend an extra day now.</p>
      <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 30px;padding:26px 30px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Website structure</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>References</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Creative direction</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Visual proposal</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Early experience decisions</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.4fr;gap:60px;padding:56px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.09);position:relative">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;position:sticky;top:110px;align-self:start">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;color:#8B5CF6">03</span><span style="width:64px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6)"></span></div>
      <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:40px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.06">Design &amp; Development</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:620px">Design and build advance together on real pages, not static mockups. You see progress as it happens; we need content and timely answers on functionality so momentum holds.</p>
      <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 30px;padding:26px 30px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Responsive design</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Page construction</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Features</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Integrations</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Content implementation</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.4fr;gap:60px;padding:56px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.09);position:relative">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;position:sticky;top:110px;align-self:start">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;color:#8B5CF6">04</span><span style="width:64px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6)"></span></div>
      <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:40px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.06">Review</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:620px">Everything is tested — across devices, content and functionality — then refined through the revision rounds confirmed in the approved project scope. Your consolidated feedback in one pass is worth more than a fortnight of scattered notes.</p>
      <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 30px;padding:26px 30px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Testing</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Content review</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Responsive review</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Revision rounds confirmed in the approved project scope</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Final refinements</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.4fr;gap:60px;padding:56px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.09);position:relative">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;position:sticky;top:110px;align-self:start">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;color:#8B5CF6">05</span><span style="width:64px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6)"></span></div>
      <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:40px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.06">Launch</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:620px">The site is published, verified and handed over properly: domain connected, final checks completed, initial support in place. You end the project owning your assets and knowing how to use them.</p>
      <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 30px;padding:26px 30px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Final quality assurance</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Domain connection</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Publication</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Initial support</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Handoff when applicable</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 72px 100px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px">
    <div style="padding:36px 40px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(37,99,255,.08),rgba(139,92,246,.05)),#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.3);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
      <h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600">Timeline confirmed after discovery and scope approval</h2>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.75">The project calendar begins once the initial payment and complete content have been received. Revision rounds confirmed in the approved project scope are included in every website project.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:36px 40px;border-radius:24px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
      <h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600">Payment structure</h2>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.75">50% to begin, 50% before launch. The final proposal may be adjusted according to scope, content and functionality.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:44px;border-radius:26px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
      <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">After launch — optional</div>
      <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.12">After launch, a different kind of relationship.</h2>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px">Those five stages complete the project. Keeping the site improving afterwards — technical care, SEO, performance and considered recommendations — runs separately as a monthly plan, from US$100/month.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><a href="/seo-growth-maintenance" data-route="seo-growth-maintenance" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;transition:background .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="6">Compare Plans</a><a href="/contact" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="5">Start a Project</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:130px 72px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:24px">
  <div data-art-id="create-contact-expansion" data-art="create-contact-expansion" data-art-slot="" style="position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:860px;height:860px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;pointer-events:none"><Artwork id="create-contact-expansion" />
    <div data-art-note="" data-art-label="" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(9,9,11,.82);border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.14);flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:520px">
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — CONTACT</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717A">Artwork Placeholder</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">1:1 centred · core 40% reserved for headline · no internal shape animation</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3F3F46">Final artwork supplied separately</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:22px;max-width:780px">
    <h2 data-h1="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:50px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.07">That is how we work. What are you building?</h2>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:17px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7;max-width:600px;text-wrap:pretty">Send the details of the project and what it needs to achieve. We will confirm scope and timing after discovery.</p>
    <div data-row="" style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:4px"><a href="/contact" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:center">Tell Us About Your Project</a><a href="/pricing" data-route="pricing" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;text-align:center">Compare Website Packages</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-slogan="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding:104px 72px 120px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;text-align:center">
  <p style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:54px;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.05;text-wrap:pretty">We Create. <span style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent">You Grow.</span></p>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
